static_electricity.Reasons for static electricity_2:
1. It is recommended that users wear cotton clothes for exercise;
2. Before using the machine and after using it, users are advised to wash their hands or touch the ground or wall with both hands to discharge any static electricity; clothes can easily generate static electricity after being rubbed during exercise
3. During exercise, you can prepare a towel, dampen one end with a small amount of water, and before testing your heart rate, you can first touch the damp towel to discharge any static electricity, to avoid getting an electric shock when your hand touches the heart rate monitor

